\" which is wrong. Actually, \"100k meters\" = 100,000 meters = 100 km. So the translator seems to have interpreted \"100k\" as \"100 km\" and then added \"मीटर\" (meters) on top of that. This is a major error - \"किमी मीटर\" is contradictory/redundant. It should be either \"100 किलोमीटर\" or \"100,000 मीटर\" or \"100 हज़ार मीटर\". The combination \"किमी मीटर\" is a major error because it's contradictory.\n\n4. \"के लिये\" - for (correct)\n5. \"प्रयास कर रहा था\" - was pushing/striving (correct, though \"कर रहा था\" would be more standard spelling)\n6. \"और\" - and (correct)\n7. \"मुझे\" - I (dative) (correct)\n8. \"वहाँ\" - there (correct, though \"वहां\" is a variant spelling)\n9. \"पहुंचना\" - to reach (correct, though \"पहुँचना\" would be more standard)\n10. \"चाहिए\" - should/ought to (correct)\n\nSo the main error is \"किमी मीटर\" which is a major error because \"किलोमीटर\" (kilometer) and \"मीटर\" (meter) are contradictory units. The source says \"100k meters\" meaning 100,000 meters. The translation says \"100 kilometer meters\" which is nonsensical.\n\nLet me mark this as a MAJOR error since it changes the meaning/creates a contradiction.\n</think>", "raw_token_ids": [9764, 728, 22903, 279, 6163, 2450, 321, 279, 42524, 14053, 25, 271, 21874, 25, 328, 40, 557, 16944, 364, 220, 16, 15, 15, 74, 19434, 411, 2182, 321, 353, 21105, 310, 615, 1017, 1149, 271, 39, 27746, 14053, 25, 328, 84237, 153357, 155292, 161855, 42201, 58069, 33228, 220, 16, 15, 15, 46215, 229557, 42201, 88077, 42201, 162316, 46215, 33228, 149145, 150709, 80752, 148514, 148355, 23121, 75681, 150290, 190393, 23121, 153491, 23121, 170729, 88077, 70184, 158822, 33228, 187635, 23121, 69858, 160837, 70184, 69858, 149043, 58069, 23121, 150129, 23121, 90703, 150709, 154845, 1, 271, 9764, 728, 1387, 411, 1441, 25, 271, 16, 13, 328, 84237, 153357, 1, 471, 353, 318, 19321, 8, 198, 17, 13, 328, 153063, 75681, 161855, 42201, 58069, 33228, 1, 471, 411, 2182, 318, 19321, 11, 3384, 328, 84237, 151566, 150256